    rdfs:comment "1.1.0 rewrites the chapter's concepts at the standard of chapter 1: every concept is explained in four to five paragraphs of connected prose with executed examples, terms the chapter uses without explaining (hash value, view, factory, hook, star syntax and others) become concepts, and the statements of the book that current Python has overtaken (no order, the unhashable message) are corrected; no 1.0.0 branch is removed, so MINOR."@en ;
